{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Immersive theater, retro-style.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with different characters and objects through point &amp; click controls, follow them around or let them follow you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/TheaterVideoShort.gif?t=1743587893\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mingle to your heart's content.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Converse extensively with others through a fully-animated, fully-ragdolled dialogue interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/SnapShort.gif?t=1743587893\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Performative, romantic and classical.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a performer, murderer and master. Intertwine their stories and bring the ceremony to a halt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/Ceremony.gif?t=1743587893\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Reveal the horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recall long-forgotten events from a distant reality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/RuthShot.gif?t=1743587893\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Let yourself go</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I have missed you for so very long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617650?t=1743587893","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/7d6ec139536ecb47019b56347e366bd25